origins-follow-panes

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Keep each tab's agent pane current: pane move gives a pane a new ID and a closed pane has none, so notes, browser reload, and browser feedback missed tabs opened before a move, and notes for a closed pane's tab were kept where no agent could fetch them.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream follows moved and closed panes for browser tab origins.
